[{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30100500_02_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30100500_02_0010","text":"哇……\n好、好大的风啊……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30100500_02_0011","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30100500_02_0020","text":"是啊……是春一番吗？\n头发要被吹得乱七八糟了……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30100500_02_0030","text":"啊…………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30100500_02_0040","text":"怎么了？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30100500_02_0050","text":"现在，樱花花瓣…………\n乘着风────"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30100500_02_0051","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30100500_02_0060","text":"……哇，真的\n附近有樱花树吗……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30100500_02_0061","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30100500_02_0070","text":"叮咚叮咚……\n请退后────"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30100500_02_0071","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30100500_02_0080","text":"不久之后，春天即将驶入三号站台……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30100500_02_0081","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30100500_02_0090","text":"叮咚叮咚……\n请退后……呢"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30100500_02_0100","text":"三号站台……春天，即将驶入……！"}]
